  "- [ ] **5.4 Deploy to Render button** in README; test it from a clean account or fork if possible\n  - [x] Button and instructions are in the README\n  - [ ] Tested on Render (needs `render.yaml` on `main` and a Render account)",
);
fs.writeFileSync(root + "docs/PHASES.md", phases);
console.log("ok");

